{
    "title": "TUDN: TU Deportes Network",
    "description": "The TUDN APP is your home for live sports, Mexican and European soccer, news and highlights en espa\u00f1ol, all from TelevisaUnivision. On TUDN app you can watch LIVE SOCCER GAMES from Univision, Unim\u00e1s, TUDN, TUDNxtra and follow the latest scores, news and videos from your favorite teams and leagues. \r\n\r\nThe TUDN app brings you LIVE games from the following leagues:\r\n- Liga MX\r\n- UEFA Champions League, UEFA Europa League, UEFA Nations League & Euro 2020\r\n- Copa MX\r\n- Mexican & US National teams\r\n- Major League Soccer (MLS)\r\n- Bundesliga\r\n- CONCACAF Champions League\r\n- FIFA World Cup Qatar 2022\u2122\r\n\r\nThe following teams:\r\n- America\r\n- Chivas\r\n- Cruz Azul\r\n- Tigres\r\n- Real Madrid\r\n- Barcelona\r\n- Juventus\r\n- Mexican National Team (El Tri)\r\n- USMNT\r\n- LA Galaxy\r\n- LAFC\r\n- Inter Miami\r\n\r\nAnd the following key players:\r\n- Lionel Messi\r\n- Cristiano Ronaldo\r\n- Chucky Lozano\r\n- Jonathan Rodr\u00edguez\r\n- Andr\u00e9-Pierre Gignac\r\n- Rogelio Funes Mori\r\n- Federico Vi\u00f1as\r\n- Roberto Alvarado\r\n\r\nStay up-to-date with the latest news on boxing, MLB, NFL, NBA, Formula 1 and tennis! You can also watch the TUDN channel live 24/7 whenever and wherever you want. You can access all live soccer matches from TUDN, and TUDNxtra channels by simply logging in to your cable TV service provider (only available in the United States and Puerto Rico).\r\n\r\nPlease note: This app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see https://nielsen.com/digitalprivacy/ for more information.\r\n\r\nThe TUDN app is FREE.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The TUDN APP is your home for live sports, Mexican and European soccer, news and highlights en espa\u00f1ol, all from TelevisaUnivision. On TUDN app you can watch LIVE SOCCER GAMES from Univision, Unim\u00e1s, TUDN, TUDNxtra and follow the latest scores, news and videos from your favorite teams and leagues. <br><br>The TUDN app brings you LIVE games from the following leagues:<br>- Liga MX<br>- UEFA Champions League, UEFA Europa League, UEFA Nations League &amp; Euro 2020<br>- Copa MX<br>- Mexican &amp; US National teams<br>- Major League Soccer (MLS)<br>- Bundesliga<br>- CONCACAF Champions League<br>- FIFA World Cup Qatar 2022\u2122<br><br>The following teams:<br>- America<br>- Chivas<br>- Cruz Azul<br>- Tigres<br>- Real Madrid<br>- Barcelona<br>- Juventus<br>- Mexican National Team (El Tri)<br>- USMNT<br>- LA Galaxy<br>- LAFC<br>- Inter Miami<br><br>And the following key players:<br>- Lionel Messi<br>- Cristiano Ronaldo<br>- Chucky Lozano<br>- Jonathan Rodr\u00edguez<br>- Andr\u00e9-Pierre Gignac<br>- Rogelio Funes Mori<br>- Federico Vi\u00f1as<br>- Roberto Alvarado<br><br>Stay up-to-date with the latest news on boxing, MLB, NFL, NBA, Formula 1 and tennis! You can also watch the TUDN channel live 24/7 whenever and wherever you want. You can access all live soccer matches from TUDN, and TUDNxtra channels by simply logging in to your cable TV service provider (only available in the United States and Puerto Rico).<br><br>Please note: This app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see https://nielsen.com/digitalprivacy/ for more information.<br><br>The TUDN app is FREE.",
